## 4. Leveling Formula

```
XP Required = (Level × 100) + (Level² × 10)
```

### Breakdown Table

| Level | XP Required | Total XP Accumulated |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | 110 | 110 |
| 5 | 750 | 2,150 |
| 10 | 2,000 | 7,150 |
| 20 | 6,000 | 30,700 |
| 30 | 12,000 | 80,700 |
| 50 | 30,000 | 443,350 |
| 75 | 63,750 | 1,481,600 |
| 100 | 110,000 | 3,787,850 |

### Formula Logic
- **Early levels (1–20):** Fast progression to keep players engaged
- **Mid levels (21–60):** Meaningful slowdown as stats mature
- **Late levels (61–100):** Steep but achievable; mastery feels earned

